#   used or rehearsed: zero shots, zero game, zero dispatch, zero Windows channel (no CreateRemoteThread,
#   no frida, no ssh, no remote host touched).
# DLL under test: stellaris_quickjs.dll, sha256 77c0c35ec5b74abc8ccb849515621aaf53abd3fdc0a5e6ab8b9466acc0c11ad0
#   — the artifact already on disk, i.e. §46's `sqjs_s46.dll` bytes. Read as a file copy only.
