The path is `.gitignore`d, but it is a local readable file, and the §45 named Windows copy
(`C:\temp\sqjs_s43.dll`) was neither needed nor touched. So both eight-frame sets are resolved in this
log: §46's in (3)/(4), §45's in (4a). The `/tmp` copies this task did hash are `29086eae…` (§38),
`35b0fb10…` (§39) and `77c0c35e…` (§46, the copy of the artifact in `zig-out/`); none of them is §45's.

